<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-STRANSKY ON THE BENCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-STRANSKY ON THE BENCH.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's World Cup winning hero Joel Stransky will be on the replacements' bench for the Barbarians in Saturday's match against Australia at Twickenham.</p>
<p>Stransky, whose drop-goal clinched victory over New Zealand in the World Cup final 18 months ago, will understudy Barbarians captain Rob Andrew.</p>
